  "title": "Campfire Breakfast Sandwich",
  "description": "This is a simple four-ingredient egg and cheese breakfast sandwich recipe for one. It is toasted in the coals of a campfire using a Hobo Pie toaster.",
  "authors": [
    "Natural Chef Michelle"
  ],
